<title>USA: Delaware Cty, Pa., GOs repriced, top yld 5.55 pct.</title>
<headline>Delaware Cty, Pa., GOs repriced, top yld 5.55 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said Thursday it repriced Delaware County, Pa.'s $29 million general obligation bond deal. The top yield was 5.55 percent in 2016.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>COUNTY OF DELAWARE, PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>RE: $29,010,000*</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa		  S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>    DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 11/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/15</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>11/15/1997		   10M    3.65  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/15/1998		  475M    4.00  %	100.00</p>
<p>11/15/1999		  490M    4.10  %	  4.10</p>
<p>11/15/2000		  515M    4.20  %	  4.25</p>
<p>11/15/2001		  545M    4.30  %	  4.375</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/15/2002		  615M    4.40  %	  4.50</p>
<p>11/15/2003		  640M    4.50  %	  4.60</p>
<p>11/15/2004		1,890M    4.60  %	  4.70</p>
<p>11/15/2005		3,075M    4.70  %	  4.80</p>
<p>11/15/2006		2,560M    4.80  %	  4.95</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/15/2007		2,675M    5.00  %	  5.05</p>
<p>11/15/2008		2,805M    5.00  %	  5.15</p>
<p>11/15/2009		1,325M    5.125 %	  5.25</p>
<p>11/15/2010		1,395M    5.125 %	  NRO</p>
<p>11/15/2011		1,465M    5.125 %	  NRO</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>11/15/2012		1,535M    5.125 %	  5.50</p>
<p>11/15/2016		7,000M    5.125 %	  5.55</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 94.92 )</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 11/15/2007    100.00</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, December 13, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on January 15, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp. - PA</p>
<p>Janney Montgomery Scott Inc.</p>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker, Inc.</p>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
